---
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |  Sort: profit.nation ASC NULLS LAST, profit.o_year DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |   Projection: profit.nation, profit.o_year, sum(profit.amount) AS sum_profit                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[profit.nation, profit.o_year]], aggr=[[sum(profit.amount)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: profit                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |         Projection: pg.public.nation.n_name AS nation, date_part(Utf8("YEAR"), pg.public.orders.o_orderdate) AS o_year, pg.public.lineitem.l_extendedprice * (Int64(1) - pg.public.lineitem.l_discount) - pg.public.partsupp.ps_supplycost * pg.public.lineitem.l_quantity AS amount                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |           Inner Join:  Filter: pg.public.supplier.s_nationkey = pg.public.nation.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |             Inner Join:  Filter: pg.public.orders.o_orderkey = pg.public.lineitem.l_orderkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |               Inner Join:  Filter: pg.public.partsupp.ps_suppkey = pg.public.lineitem.l_suppkey AND pg.public.partsupp.ps_partkey = pg.public.lineitem.l_partkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |                 Inner Join:  Filter: pg.public.supplier.s_suppkey = pg.public.lineitem.l_suppkey AND pg.public.part.p_partkey = pg.public.lineitem.l_partkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                   Cross Join:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                     TableScan: pg.public.part projection=[p_partkey], full_filters=[pg.public.part.p_name LIKE Utf8("%green%")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                     TableScan: pg.public.supplier projection=[s_suppkey, s_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                   TableScan: pg.public.lineitem projection=[l_orderkey, l_partkey, l_suppkey, l_quantity, l_extendedprice, l_discount]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |                 TableScan: pg.public.partsupp projection=[ps_partkey, ps_suppkey, ps_supplycost]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |               TableScan: pg.public.orders projection=[o_orderkey, o_orderdate]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |             TableScan: pg.public.nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=postgres compute_context=host=Tcp("benchmarking-postgres-rw.dataplatform.svc.cluster.local"),port=5432,db=tpch_sf1,user=postgres, base_sql=SELECT "profit"."nation", "profit"."o_year", sum("profit"."amount") AS "sum_profit" FROM (SELECT "nation"."n_name" AS "nation", date_part('YEAR', "orders"."o_orderdate") AS "o_year", (("lineitem"."l_extendedprice" * (1 - "lineitem"."l_discount")) - ("partsupp"."ps_supplycost" * "lineitem"."l_quantity")) AS "amount" FROM "public"."part" INNER JOIN "public"."supplier" ON "part"."p_name" LIKE '%green%' INNER JOIN "public"."lineitem" ON (("supplier"."s_suppkey" = "lineitem"."l_suppkey") AND ("part"."p_partkey" = "lineitem"."l_partkey")) INNER JOIN "public"."partsupp" ON (("partsupp"."ps_suppkey" = "lineitem"."l_suppkey") AND ("partsupp"."ps_partkey" = "lineitem"."l_partkey")) INNER JOIN "public"."orders" ON ("orders"."o_orderkey" = "lineitem"."l_orderkey") INNER JOIN "public"."nation" ON ("supplier"."s_nationkey" = "nation"."n_nationkey")) AS "profit" GROUP BY "profit"."nation", "profit"."o_year" ORDER BY "profit"."nation" ASC NULLS LAST, "profit"."o_year" DESC NULLS FIRST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
